Check these all tings are perfect or not or saem - Android App Icon Requirements
Store Listing Icon: 512 × 512 pixels PNG.
Adaptive Launcher Icons: Foreground and background layers at 108 × 108 dp with a safe zone of about 72 × 72 dp in the center so elements don't get clipped by device masks.
Format: PNG file under 1024 KB.
Corners & Shadows: Do not add your own rounded corners or drop shadows; the launcher applies shapes and theme tints. 